{"summary":"Storyteller Game! Match and Connect Emoji & Solve Tricky Riddles!","description":"Emoji Story: Tricky Puzzles is a fun puzzle game where you can craft surprising endings by dragging and dropping the provided emojis and characters. Step into the world of emojis and use your wits to match colorful emojis and solve puzzles at each level!\nAs a great storyteller, use your imagination to complete the story. Looking for a funny puzzle game? Emoji Story: Tricky Puzzles is just for you! A super fun and exciting puzzle game with emojis is waiting for you. All you need is a rich imagination and vivid guess skills to match the emojis. If you correctly match all the emojis, you pass the level.\nIn each level emojis are carefully designed. A mix of easy and difficult emojis is included. In Emoji Story: Tricky Puzzles, all the fun emojis will logically match, helping you to train your imagination.\nChallenge your imagination with Emoji Story: Tricky Puzzles and enjoy a fun puzzle experience!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $5.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JFo6pfMsWyk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sDYdbZcFegUL5Cd6bczwvIWK4zOGDn1G8QGGKDnlteLGTmgL7qYEMGw-zkM6fnfEqoR7s5XjPr7bdsvTnhyiCg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d-c36cPrpDta95WsEpUmSbATBcU2gTwAqoj-DPA8IDrJUrt4FmOeMmZkDoFHjZiVCo4uSmW0GPqYrGTPkxMi","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/s7tvEpn3ihvJGd6n1a56Ute3d2rTVlfbGqoso8E52sTEdTtTHnAsh4-PJoZ7DTPJP1EO5EzfxuBUDO_er--ojzE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eXx-7W5M1GzPzRGmYzcdDi1xlHuSwObk8ZDRL8zDsQ_A1knWuZ4XA8eqkjKpcFiIrO2c4u5k97yz5yijCrk0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ge2Vzd-8B47okzagO4ID9Cx6alsdRYpC3YRXh2gvdnjD4D7-uhpGGQqjmkdt5cqi9E-oCR3an3hmUyfA_PdX","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wwIbTx9bfBIsJgabO1315igL9MQYI-1X65s88v8hLxpYAu8dUw0O5sWhpnucMnt6e1g2Z31iD3XCr29_y3tDFQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jMiwMKZDZIlxXM